# Admin design language

Full guide: [docs/admin-design-language.md](mdc:docs/admin-design-language.md).

**References:** `app/routes/admin/products/index.jsx` (lists), `app/components/admin/product-editor.jsx` (detail).

## Always

- Semantic tokens only (`bg`, `surface`, `surface-2`, `border`, `text`, `text-muted`, `accent`, `success`/`warn`/`danger`) — no gradients, glass, or glow in admin.
- Prefer `#/components/admin/*` primitives over one-off markup.
- Heroicons only.

## List pages

`PageHeader` → optional `Stat` grid → bordered `Toolbar` + `SearchField` → `Table variant="sticky"` (or `EmptyState`) → `Pagination`.

- Sticky table: `sticky` on `THead`/`TBody`/`Th`/`Td`; no overflow wrapper.
- Rows navigate to detail (click + Enter/Space); primary cell = title + muted mono meta; `Badge` for status/tags.
- Hide secondary columns with `sm:`/`md:`/`lg:table-cell`.

## Detail pages

`mx-auto max-w-5xl` → `PageHeader` + `Breadcrumbs` → two-column `FormSection` stack (`space-y-12`, `md:grid-cols-3`) → footer (delete left · cancel + `ButtonSubmit` right).

- Save in footer, not header. Header actions = secondary workflows (e.g. publish).
- Forms: `Field` / `Input` / `Textarea` / `Select` / `SlugField` / `SeoFields` / `LocaleTabs`.
- Alerts via `SuccessAlert` / `ErrorAlert` from `actionData`.

## Don’t

- Ad-hoc `gray-*`/`zinc-*` tables or headers.
- Overflow wrappers around sticky list tables.
- Cards as the main list composition (use stats + toolbar + table).
